# v1.9.0:
- New mod menu integrated with the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3691154596]Community Mod Framework[/url]
- New automation to automatically join / take over subject wars
- New settings to control automatic map sharing
- New global settings for blocking colonization, urbanization, columbian exchange, and declaring war for all subjects.
- Interactions now dynamically hide when the global setting is enabled
